WEBVTT

00:12.800 --> 00:16.720
So what's new, Mark? How is your new job going?

00:17.680 --> 00:20.640
To be honest, I can't complain.

00:21.600 --> 00:24.720
I really love the company that I am working for.

00:26.330 --> 00:29.850
My co workers are all really friendly and helpful.

00:30.650 --> 00:34.610
They really help me feel welcome. It's a

00:35.110 --> 00:39.050
really energetic and fun atmosphere. My boss

00:39.550 --> 00:42.730
is hilarious and he's really flexible.

00:43.690 --> 00:46.490
Really? How so?

00:47.610 --> 00:51.380
He allows me to come in when I want and

00:51.880 --> 00:55.380
make my own hours. I can also leave early

00:55.460 --> 00:58.980
if I start early. There is no real

00:59.480 --> 01:03.300
dress code either. I can wear jeans and a T shirt

01:03.800 --> 01:07.620
if I want. I can even wear shorts in the summer.

01:08.500 --> 01:11.540
Wow, it sounds really cool.

01:12.420 --> 01:15.860
I can't stand wearing a suit every day.

01:16.750 --> 01:19.910
Which do you prefer? Working late or

01:20.410 --> 01:23.710
finishing early? I prefer finishing early.

01:24.670 --> 01:28.470
I really enjoy the morning. I love getting

01:28.970 --> 01:32.590
up early and going for a run. There's nothing

01:32.669 --> 01:36.430
like watching the sunrise while drinking my morning coffee.

01:37.710 --> 01:40.910
Really? I am opposite.

01:41.710 --> 01:45.790
I love sleeping in. I am most

01:46.290 --> 01:49.950
alert in the evenings. I'm a real night owl.

01:54.270 --> 01:57.710
Well, you know what they say. The early

01:58.210 --> 02:01.870
bird catches the worm. You know, you could be right.

02:02.990 --> 02:06.430
Maybe I will try to go to bed a little earlier

02:06.590 --> 02:07.230
tonight.
